
# https://github.com/Evercoder/culori

# A sketch, shelved: 48 conversions declared with no bodies, over color forms (`rgb-color`, `a98-color` and the rest)
# this file does not load and most of which are declared nowhere. It built only while an unknown type was read as no
# type at all, and the build refuses that since 2026-10-03 (check/type-names.ts). Nothing loads it
mark draft

load @term/base/mixin/each
  find define-each

fuse define-each, read space
  read define-space

host space
  term a98
  term cubehelix
  term dlch
  term hsi
  term hsl
  term hsv
  term hwb
  term jab
  term jch
  term lab
  term lab65
  term lch
  term lchuv
  term lrgb
  term luv
  term okhsl
  term okhsv
  term oklab
  term p3
  term prophoto
  term rec2020
  term xyz50
  term xyz65
  term yiq

tree define-space
  take name

  hook bind
    task convert-rgb-to-{name}-space
      take value, like rgb-color
      like {name}-color

    task convert-{name}-to-rgb-space
      take value, like {name}-color
      like rgb-color
